in paragraph (3)(A), by striking “for the reasonable cost of carrying out such arrangement, and” and inserting “for—“(i) the agency’s proportional share (as determined by the Commissioner in consultation with the head of the agency) of—“(I) the payments to States required under paragraph (2)(A);
“(II) the costs to the Commissioner of developing the contracts described in paragraph (1); and
“(III) the costs to the Commissioner of carrying out the study required under section 802 of division FF of the Consolidated Appropriations Act, 2021; and

